# GameML — environment template.
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in. NEVER commit real values.
#
# GameML runs ALL machine learning client-side (TensorFlow.js / Pyodide).
# None of these keys are required to play a game — they only power tooling
# (GitHub MCP) and progression persistence (Supabase).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub — consumed by the `github` MCP server in .mcp.json.
# Scope: repo (issues + PRs). Server-side / tooling only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase — SERVER-ONLY credentials.
# Used by the `supabase` MCP server and any server-side progression writes.
#
# ⚠️  SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY bypasses Row Level Security. It must NEVER be
#     prefixed with NEXT_PUBLIC_ and must NEVER reach the browser bundle.
#     If both of these are absent, `progression` falls back to localStorage.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase — BROWSER-SAFE credentials (anon key, protected by RLS).
# These are what the client-side progression service uses to record XP,
# mastery stars, and badges. Safe to expose; still not committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
